 r←RunHouseKeeping server
⍝ Runs house keeping - `OnServerTimeout` - and notes when it ran.
⍝ Both paths through `ServerWait` come here rather than calling `OnServerTimeout`
⍝ themselves, so that the note cannot be forgotten on one of the two.
 server.LastHouseKeeping←SecondsNow
 r←server OnServerTimeout 0
⍝Done
